H-Hey!

19:32.670 --> 19:36.780
Looks like pictures and freshly washed
panties aren't enough for you.

19:38.780 --> 19:41.780
What do you think?
Better than the photo, right?

19:41.780 --> 19:43.640
<i>Actually pretty cute...</i>

19:43.640 --> 19:46.030
<i>I didn't think Raika'd look good
in something like that.</i>

19:46.030 --> 19:48.380
I'll give you these, freshly worn.

19:48.380 --> 19:50.140
That must be good enough, right?

19:50.140 --> 19:51.850
Indeed!

19:51.850 --> 19:54.460
Wait, that's really bad!

19:54.460 --> 19:57.550
As a cameraman, my job is to do
whatever it takes for the photo.

19:57.840 --> 19:59.760
D-Don't take that off!

20:03.660 --> 20:05.860
Do you plan to take me?

20:05.860 --> 20:07.760
No, um...

20:07.760 --> 20:10.190
I didn't expect you to be the one taking it.

20:10.190 --> 20:11.690
I-I'm sorry!

20:13.790 --> 20:15.410
You chicken!

20:15.410 --> 20:18.340
If you can't do it, I will!

20:18.340 --> 20:20.150
S-Stop...

20:20.150 --> 20:21.470
What?

20:21.470 --> 20:23.820
I'm the only one this will hurt.

20:30.240 --> 20:32.860
I... I...

20:32.860 --> 20:34.480
They're watching me.

20:35.110 --> 20:36.860
My ugliness...

20:36.860 --> 20:39.630
I'm watching.

20:40.280 --> 20:41.890
Raika?

20:41.890 --> 20:43.310
Don't look at me!

20:43.310 --> 20:45.640
No! Don't look at me!

20:48.140 --> 20:50.850
The female cameraman realized

20:50.850 --> 20:53.470
a million eyes were on her.

20:53.470 --> 20:57.750
And that everything about her was being revealed.

20:59.150 --> 21:01.010
She could hide nothing.

21:01.010 --> 21:04.100
Because that was what she wanted.

21:04.490 --> 21:06.130
She wished to be seen.

21:08.610 --> 21:10.030
No!

21:10.030 --> 21:12.140
She was waiting...

21:12.140 --> 21:14.510
to be displayed...

21:14.510 --> 21:17.010
Displayed in all her shamefulness.

21:18.030 --> 21:20.820
What she wanted to photograph,
more than anything,

21:20.820 --> 21:23.050
was right before her.

21:23.050 --> 21:25.290
Show them. Show them...

21:25.290 --> 21:27.220
How ugly you are!

21:27.590 --> 21:29.250
Show yourself!

21:33.730 --> 21:35.310
Ugly...

21:36.490 --> 21:38.560
I am ugly.

21:39.060 --> 21:40.600
You're ugly!

21:40.610 --> 21:44.150
Raika!

21:49.600 --> 21:51.580
I finished the poster, Taketo.

21:53.190 --> 21:55.140
Looks like you're out of your slump.

21:55.140 --> 21:57.700
Yeah. I think I'm over it.

21:57.700 --> 21:59.710
I feel better.

22:00.650 --> 22:02.250
It's thanks to you.

22:02.250 --> 22:04.100
No, well...

22:04.100 --> 22:05.310
I'm glad.

22:05.310 --> 22:06.880
Look at this!

22:07.160 --> 22:09.260
It's perfect.

22:09.260 --> 22:11.570
Wh-What is this?

22:11.570 --> 22:13.760
It's my way of saying thanks.

22:13.760 --> 22:15.060
How?

22:17.140 --> 22:19.740
Aren't you embarrassed?

22:19.740 --> 22:23.360
The greatest cameraman makes
for the greatest subject.

22:23.360 --> 22:24.260
Right?

22:24.260 --> 22:26.070
Then just photograph yourself.

22:26.860 --> 22:31.390
Since we're both ugly,
don't you think we make a good pair?

22:33.820 --> 22:36.730
Hey there, that FLASHY POWER needs more energy!

22:36.730 --> 22:39.770
Shout HURRAY, and raise the words of PEACE to the sky!

22:51.300 --> 22:54.220
Come, be HAPPY first thing in the morning; love KNOWS the outcome of the underwear battle!

22:54.220 --> 22:57.020
Hold on! Keep this a secret, it feels awfully squishy down below; it feels amazing.

22:57.020 --> 22:58.460
Since you're taking a peek, darling,

22:58.460 --> 22:59.870
shall I give you myself, you virgin!

22:59.870 --> 23:02.380
Oh my, you WARNING me about your arousal? I'm OKAY with that!

23:02.380 --> 23:07.950
Let's jump into the heaven that is a sparkling room!

23:07.950 --> 23:10.610
SAY EVERYBODY, we can reply to our pleasant feelings.

23:10.610 --> 23:13.070
It's time to run and PLAY BALL!

23:13.070 --> 23:15.990
Let's go! Long live PEACE! Don't give up PEACE!

23:15.990 --> 23:18.800
Today we'll surely have 'ecchi' moments,

23:18.800 --> 23:24.450
Raise your hands and JUMP! God of HIGH-TENSION, beware!

23:24.450 --> 23:27.460
Once more! Long live PEACE! Everything is all right, PEACE!

23:27.460 --> 23:30.210
Laugh and smile more, it'll always be sunny

23:30.210 --> 23:36.240
Full marks! When I'm confident with my bosoms, I'll leave you a wonderful 'ecchi' feeling!

23:36.660 --> 23:39.580
See here, SKIP that FLASHY POWER and line up!

23:39.580 --> 23:42.310
Shout HURRAY and PEACE! It's a parade, let's go!

24:02.440 --> 24:05.860
Today's Nosebleed Gauge

24:06.380 --> 24:14.430
OP

24:07.280 --> 24:08.670
Don't spill it!

24:08.670 --> 24:12.430
I'm the one they'll get mad at.

24:12.430 --> 24:27.440
Next Time:
"Beyond Friends with Benefits"

24:12.780 --> 24:14.370
This is Meiki Raika.

24:14.370 --> 24:16.670
Not there! How many times must I tell you?

24:16.670 --> 24:18.070
That's not where it itches...

24:20.560 --> 24:22.200
Are you an idiot at this?

24:24.610 --> 24:26.050
Not there! Hey!

24:26.050 --> 24:27.440
Don't touch that!
